{"5092690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "K-PARTY FEVER", "steam_appid": 5092690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>K-PARTY FEVER Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/4ea39377acb272493fb164974cfef5bf.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/4ea39377acb272493fb164974cfef5bf.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K-PARTY FEVER is an online party game for up to 8 players, inspired by fast-paced Korean group games built around timing, quick reactions, bluffing, and reading the room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a series of short and intuitive games where you must read the other players, think fast, and react within a limited time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can completely turn the game around, and every loss reduces your Mental HP. Keep your cool, protect your HP, and survive until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>K-PARTY FEVER Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/ff16ed03c88f969d8156f58dbfdfca81.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/ff16ed03c88f969d8156f58dbfdfca81.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Korean Party Games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Classic Korean group games such as 369, 007 Bang, and APT Game are reimagined as fast-paced online multiplayer games. Even if you have never played them before, the rules are designed to be simple and easy to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/37e80948815ab16320003bb274f2c7c9.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/37e80948815ab16320003bb274f2c7c9.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Up to 8-Player Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Up to 8 players can gather together and compete through a series of party games. Invite your friends and play together in a private room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/3f68a7f815e28060a7e3bdf2d2cc2297.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/3f68a7f815e28060a7e3bdf2d2cc2297.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Easy to Learn, Hard to Relax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The rules are simple, but you will need to think and react quickly under time pressure. A single mistake can change the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/d0b136fc6bea2389d6b1f0afe2b57f04.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/d0b136fc6bea2389d6b1f0afe2b57f04.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Mental Survival System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Your Mental HP carries over throughout the entire match. Protect your mental state, manage your HP carefully, and survive until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/c351aaf646267745d43e16c16c7f5f2c.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/c351aaf646267745d43e16c16c7f5f2c.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Punishment Games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Losing a game is not the end. Punishment games keep the pressure and tension going throughout the entire match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Expressive Character Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Characters react with a variety of expressions and animations depending on mistakes, wins, and losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Just as Fun to Watch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Who will make the next mistake? Who will face the punishment? And who will survive until the very end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Watching the chaos unfold is all part of the fun in K-PARTY FEVER.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>K-PARTY FEVER Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/4ea39377acb272493fb164974cfef5bf.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/4ea39377acb272493fb164974cfef5bf.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K-PARTY FEVER is an online party game for up to 8 players, inspired by fast-paced Korean group games built around timing, quick reactions, bluffing, and reading the room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a series of short and intuitive games where you must read the other players, think fast, and react within a limited time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"