ass=\"bb_tag\" >- Easy to Learn, Hard to Relax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The rules are simple, but you will need to think and react quickly under time pressure. A single mistake can change the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/d0b136fc6bea2389d6b1f0afe2b57f04.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/d0b136fc6bea2389d6b1f0afe2b57f04.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Mental Survival System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Your Mental HP carries over throughout the entire match. Protect your mental state, manage your HP carefully, and survive until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras/c351aaf646267745d43e16c16c7f5f2c.avif?t=1788137024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092690/extras_big/c351aaf646267745d43e16c16c7f5f2c.webp?t=1788137024 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Punishment Games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Losing a game is not the end. Punishment games keep the pressure and tension going throughout the entire match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Expressive Character Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Characters react with a variety of expressions and animations depending on mistakes, wins, and losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Just as Fun to Watch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Who will make the next mistake? Who will face the punishment? And who will survive until the very end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Watching the chaos unfold is all part of the fun in K-PARTY FEVER.</p>", "short_description": 